```
"execute": {
    "properties": {
        "mode": {...},
        "request": {...},
        "target": {...}
    }
}
```

So my function could have `target` instead of request. Target is:
```
"target": {
    "$ref": "#/$defs/EntityRef",
    "description": "EntityRef-shaped pointer to an existing `request` entity."
}
